  Mode and sub-mode names (Fischer, Bronstein, Byoyomi, Hourglass, Shared, Overtime…) and chess
  variant names carry translatable="false" in values/strings.xml: they are the fixed vocabulary
  printed on tournament clocks and written in federation rulebooks. Only their descriptions are
  translated here.

  app_name is left out on purpose — it is the product name.

  Translated without a native reviewer, like the Spanish.
-->
